                <Param name="text" val="Great work!&#10;&#10;Your other task throughout this session is to detect a number of stimuli that might be presented while the tracking task is ocurring. We call this second task the &quot;detection task&quot;. The detection task can consist of a light (positioned above your monitor), or a vibration (through the buzzer on your collarbone).&#10;&#10;Whenever you detect any of these stimuli you should press the button on your left hand as soon as possible.&#10;&#10;To move to the next screen, press spacebar." valType="str" updates="constant" plugin="None"/>
