                <Param name="text" val="Let's practice the detection task.&#10;&#10;Focus on the cross in the middle of the screen. For a period of 60 seconds, the light or vibration stimuli will randomly appear. You should press the button as quickly as possible whenever you notice them.&#10;&#10;To begin the detection practice, press spacebar." valType="str" updates="constant" plugin="None"/>
